  <div class="s-backed-by-science__container">
    <header class="s-backed-by-science__header"><p class="s-backed-by-science__eyebrow">Backed By Science</p><h2 class="s-backed-by-science__title" id="s-backed-by-science-title-template--26717513089391__backed_by_science_VNNFmb"><p>How Pumpkin Seed Regrowth Oil Works</p></h2><p class="s-backed-by-science__subtitle">5 research-backed ways it targets why women’s hair thins after 35. No drugs, no hormones, just pumpkin seed oil and caffeine.</p></header>

    <div class="s-backed-by-science__body"><picture aria-hidden="true" class="s-backed-by-science__images">
        <source height="225" media="(max-width: 767.98px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0473/9999/3493/files/Frame_1484582070.png?v=1776953442&amp;width=700&amp;format=webp" width="350"/>
