      </picture><ol class="s-backed-by-science__list"><li class="s-backed-by-science__item">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="s-backed-by-science__num">1</span>
              <article class="s-backed-by-science__card">
                <picture class="s-backed-by-science__icon">
                  <source media="(max-width: 767.98px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0473/9999/3493/files/Frame_41_2x_a1754f28-b6a2-4e98-b12c-c6525d643a78.svg_5.png?v=1776935871"/>
                  <img alt="" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://froyaorganics.com/cdn/shop/files/Frame_41_2x_a1754f28-b6a2-4e98-b12c-c6525d643a78_svg.png" width="36"/>
                </picture><h3 class="s-backed-by-science__card-title">Blocks DHT At The Follicle</h3><p class="s-backed-by-science__card-text">Pumpkin seed oil is rich in phytosterols shown to inhibit 5-alpha-reductase, the enzyme that turns testosterone into DHT: the hormone that shrinks follicles in female pattern hair loss.</p></article>
            </li><li class="s-backed-by-science__item">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="s-backed-by-science__num">2</span>
              <article class="s-backed-by-science__card">
                <picture class="s-backed-by-science__icon">
                  <source media="(max-width: 767.98px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0473/9999/3493/files/Frame_41_2x_a1754f28-b6a2-4e98-b12c-c6525d643a78.svg_6.png?v=1776935871"/>
                  <img alt="" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://froyaorganics.com/cdn/shop/files/Frame_41_2x_a1754f28-b6a2-4e98-b12c-c6525d643a78.svg_6.png" width="36"/>
                </picture><h3 class="s-backed-by-science__card-title">Wakes Up Dormant Follicles</h3><p class="s-backed-by-science__card-text">Our Caffeine Complex counteracts DHT’s suppression of follicle growth and has been shown to prolong the anagen (growth) phase in female hair follicles.</p></article>
            </li><li class="s-backed-by-science__item">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="s-backed-by-science__num">3</span>
              <article class="s-backed-by-science__card">
                <picture class="s-backed-by-science__icon">
                  <source media="(max-width: 767.98px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0473/9999/3493/files/Frame_41_2x_a1754f28-b6a2-4e98-b12c-c6525d643a78.svg_7.png?v=1776935871"/>
                  <img alt="" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://froyaorganics.com/cdn/shop/files/Frame_41_2x_a1754f28-b6a2-4e98-b12c-c6525d643a78.svg_7.png" width="36"/>
                </picture><h3 class="s-backed-by-science__card-title">Boosts Blood Flow To The Root</h3><p class="s-backed-by-science__card-text">Caffeine plus a 60-second scalp massage stimulates microcirculation, so oxygen and nutrients reach the follicles that have been starved of them.</p></article>
            </li><li class="s-backed-by-science__item">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="s-backed-by-science__num">4</span>
              <article class="s-backed-by-science__card">
