                  <img alt="" decoding="async" height="36" loading="lazy" src="https://froyaorganics.com/cdn/shop/files/Frame_41_2x_a1754f28-b6a2-4e98-b12c-c6525d643a78.svg_3.png" width="36"/>
                </picture><h3 class="s-backed-by-science__card-title">Strengthens Every Strand</h3><p class="s-backed-by-science__card-text">Omega-3, 6 and 9 fatty acids, zinc and vitamin E nourish the hair shaft and cut breakage, so the hair you grow is hair you keep.</p></article>
            </li><li class="s-backed-by-science__item">
