                </picture><h3 class="s-backed-by-science__card-title">Calms An Irritated Scalp</h3><p class="s-backed-by-science__card-text">Anti-inflammatory tocopherols and carotenoids soothe itching, dryness and inflammation, giving follicles the healthy environment they need to grow.</p></article>
